    "text": "For the Compounds :\n(A) \\(\\mathrm{H}_3 \\mathrm{C}-\\mathrm{CH}_2-\\mathrm{O}-\\mathrm{CH}_2-\\mathrm{CH}_2-\\mathrm{CH}_3\\)\n(B) \\(\\mathrm{H}_3 \\mathrm{C}-\\mathrm{CH}_2^2-\\mathrm{CH}_2-\\mathrm{CH}_2-\\mathrm{CH}_3\\)\n(C) <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/da5nvlYr1CIhuE3HoUe6xh-jy9aJGaqxf5PzQZVmLFA.original.fullsize.png\"><br />(D)<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/v25OHCYOnWku4s3HETq76vociqZ6YZaQvMrSuFuQpFw.original.fullsize.png\"><br />The increasing order of boiling point is :\nChoose the correct answer from the options given below :",
